 "description": "The SQLCipher Cryptographic Module is a cryptographic engine that integrates with SQLCipher, enhancing encrypted database operations with a trusted security layer. SQLCipher provides full database encryption and data integrity protection for local storage at rest. This module guarantees that all data stored and retrieved through SQLCipher is encrypted, decrypted, and verified using a reliable implementation for applications demanding high levels of data security.",
